  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given that the galvanometer has <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;divisions and the current required for deflection one division is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p>current for full scale deflection <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math></p><p><br />To use this galvanometer as a voltmeter for a maximum voltage of&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, we need to add a resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math>&nbsp;in series to the resistance of the galvanometer of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>G</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;such that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>G</mi></mrow></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>50</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>=</mo><mn>200</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ohm</mi></math></p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
